================================================================================
DATABASE SCHEMA
================================================================================

Tables Created (via SUPABASE_SETUP.md):

1. user_profiles
   - id (BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY)
   - user_id (UUID FOREIGN KEY → auth.users)
   - name (TEXT)
   - phone (TEXT)
   - created_at (TIMESTAMP)

2. carts
   - id (BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY)
   - user_id (UUID FOREIGN KEY)
   - product_id (TEXT)
   - product_name (TEXT)
   - quantity (INTEGER)
   - price_at_add (DECIMAL)
   - created_at (TIMESTAMP)
   - UNIQUE(user_id, product_id)

3. orders
   - id (BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY)
   - user_id (UUID FOREIGN KEY)
   - total_price (DECIMAL)
   - delivery_address (TEXT)
   - status (TEXT) - 'pending', 'shipped', 'delivered'
   - created_at (TIMESTAMP)

4. order_items
   - id (BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY)
   - order_id (BIGINT FOREIGN KEY)
   - product_id (TEXT)
   - product_name (TEXT)
   - quantity (INTEGER)
   - price (DECIMAL)
   - created_at (TIMESTAMP)

5. wishlist
   - id (BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY)
   - user_id (UUID FOREIGN KEY)
   - product_id (TEXT)
   - product_name (TEXT)
   - created_at (TIMESTAMP)
   - UNIQUE(user_id, product_id)

RLS Policies Applied:
  ✓ All tables have RLS enabled
  ✓ Users can only view/modify their own data
  ✓ Isolation prevents cross-user data access

