================================================================================
DEBUGGING & COMMON ISSUES
================================================================================

Issue: "Supabase is not defined"
Solution: Check SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_KEY in source/supabaseClient.js

Issue: Cart not saving to database
Solution: Verify RLS policies are enabled and user_id matches auth.users

Issue: "User not authenticated" when adding to cart
Solution: Login first before adding items

Issue: Google login not working
Solution: Configure OAuth in Supabase Authentication settings and set redirect URL

Issue: Cart count not updating
Solution: Check browser console for errors, verify Supabase connection

Debug Commands (Browser Console):
  - supabase.auth.getUser() - Check current user
  - supabase.auth.getSession() - Check session details
  - localStorage.getItem('sb-token') - View auth token

